@@ -0,0 +1,44 @@
+# Portfolio & Admin Dashboard Architecture Specification — Implementation Tracker
+
+This tracker follows the uploaded 21-page specification. It is maintained on the preview branch and does not authorize production changes.
+
+## Implemented in this preview work
+
+- [x] Private media vault table and reference tracking, separate from the pre-existing legacy MediaAsset table.
+- [x] Admin multi-file selection and drag/drop upload, direct signed object upload, progress, MIME/extension checks, magic-byte verification, format/size allowlists, filename sanitization, SVG active-content sanitization, checksum, and image WebP variants.
+- [x] Private/public media delivery, authenticated private previews, range-capable video delivery, metadata/tags, category/search filters, pagination, linked-reference count, and deletion protection.
+- [x] Inline local uploads added beside existing URL workflows in Profile, Projects, and Blog; existing fields and content behavior retained.
+- [x] Project/Profile/Blog media references synchronized; published content requires attached media to be public.
+- [x] Blog cover image and companion download, automatic reading time, editable SEO title/description, Markdown live preview and public rendering, GFM tables, syntax highlighting/code-copy, LaTeX, generated heading IDs/TOC, sharing and previous/next navigation.
+- [x] CV version controller with Industry/Academic tracks, PDF and optional DOCX, active-version switching, archived revisions, download counter, and public download endpoint.
+- [x] Additive preview database migrations applied; existing preview content and legacy table preserved.
+
+## Remaining specification work — not yet complete
+
+### Public portfolio
+- [ ] Dynamic global identity/SEO/social-card metadata, configurable navigation and section visibility, maintenance mode.
+- [ ] Project case-study detail blocks, benchmarks, demo videos and labeled multi-format attachments.
+- [ ] Skills tiers, custom icons, visibility/order controls.
+- [ ] Education coursework, academic honors, thesis/capstone and transcript/defense artifacts.
+- [ ] Experience impact bullets, tech-stack tags, organization logos and verification artifacts.
+- [ ] Publications/certifications/honors section and verification links.
+- [ ] Testimonials/recommendations section and approval workflow.
+- [ ] Blog scheduled publishing, article metadata polish and companion archive behavior.
+- [ ] CV preview/print modal and multi-track selector beyond the current download links.
+- [ ] Contact inquiry types, robust anti-spam/rate limits, scheduling link and complete success/error UX.
+
+### Admin control dashboard
+- [ ] TOTP/OAuth options, active-session revocation, immutable audit trail and full security telemetry.
+- [ ] Real page-view/CV-download analytics, time-range charts, referrals, top content and storage gauge.
+- [ ] Global Site Settings/SEO/Navigation editor and maintenance-mode controller.
+- [ ] Complete project case-study/artifact editor and reorder/featured controls.
+- [ ] Skills category/proficiency/icon manager.
+- [ ] Education/Experience extended fields and inline artifact uploaders.
+- [ ] Publications/Certifications, Testimonials and recommendation-request managers.
+- [ ] Blog scheduling and complete editorial workflow.
+- [ ] Contact inbox status/reply/archive/spam/internal-note controls.
+- [ ] Full media pipeline enhancements: video poster extraction/transcoding metadata, PDF page previews, Office metadata, ZIP manifests, and complete cross-module reference reconciliation.
+
+## Verification gate
+
+A module is only marked complete after its admin workflow, public rendering/API, persistence, authorization, validation, and relevant tests are verified on the preview deployment. Production must remain unchanged until separately authorized.
